# Lab 3 — Remove the stalls: the checks of a solution
# (python3 -m emips check YOUR_PROGRAM.asm --checks docs/guide/labs/lab3_sum.check;
#  next to lab3_sum.asm, check lab3_sum.asm finds it by itself)
eMIPS: --pipeline
check: output is "36"          (it computes the same sum)
check: stalls == 0             (nothing waits)
check: cycles <= 53            (and the delay slot does useful work)
